[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891986\">5580E22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the covers.</p><p>2. Undo the bolts.</p><p>3. Gently move aside the courtesy light unit and disconnect the\nelectrical connections (3a, 3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Adjustable mirror control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890375\">H30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Adjustable / folding mirrors control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890377\">H31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Adjustable mirror control</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890375\">H30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Recover the courtesy light unit.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035741.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the courtesy light\nis undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Fit the courtesy light and tighten the\nbolts.</p><p>Fit the covers.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891986\">5580E22</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Check that the controls in the courtesy\nlight work.</p>"]]